.Dd April 2, 2026
.Dt EX 1
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm ex
.Nd line-oriented text editor with a visual mode
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl RrsSv
.Op Fl c Ar command
.Op Fl t Ar tag
.Op Fl w Ar size
.Op Ar +command
.Op Ar file
.Op Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility is Substrate's shared-core line editor.
It provides a BSD-first
line-editor command language backed by the shared
.Pa usr.lib/exvi
implementation used by both
.Nm
and
.Xr vi 1 .
.Pp
Commands are read from standard input in batch mode or from the controlling
terminal in interactive mode.
Interactive sessions display a
.Ql \&:
prompt before each command.
.Pp
The current supported command contract includes:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It visual mode
.Ic visual ,
.Ic vi
.It version
.Ic version ,
.Ic ver
.It argument list
.Ic args ,
.Ic ar ,
.Ic next ,
.Ic n ,
.Ic prev ,
.Ic rewind ,
.Ic rew
.It recovery and session control
.Ic preserve ,
.Ic pre ,
.Ic recover ,
.Ic rec ,
.Ic pop ,
.Ic po
.It tags and options
.Ic tag ,
.Ic ta ,
.Ic tags ,
.Ic set ,
.Ic se
.It file lifecycle
.Ic quit ,
.Ic q ,
.Ic xit ,
.Ic x ,
.Ic wq ,
.Ic write ,
.Ic w ,
.Ic edit ,
.Ic e ,
.Ic read ,
.Ic r
.It line and buffer operations
.Ic delete ,
.Ic d ,
.Ic undo ,
.Ic u ,
.Ic put ,
.Ic pu ,
.Ic print ,
.Ic p ,
.Ic number ,
.Ic \&# ,
.Ic list ,
.Ic l ,
.Ic = ,
.Ic mark ,
.Ic ma ,
.Ic k Ns Ar letter ,
.Ic file ,
.Ic f ,
.Ic append ,
.Ic a ,
.Ic insert ,
.Ic i ,
.Ic change ,
.Ic c
.It copy and movement operations
.Ic copy ,
.Ic co ,
.Ic t ,
.Ic move ,
.Ic m ,
.Ic join ,
.Ic j ,
.Ic yank ,
.Ic y
.It regex and shell operations
